==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈmɒn.əʊ.θeɪ.ɪst.ɪk/|lang=en}}

===Etymology===
{{prefix|en|mono|theistic}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{lb|en|religion}} Believing in a single [[god]], [[deity]], [[spirit]], etc., especially for an organized [[religion]], [[faith]], or [[creed]].

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|monotheism}}
* {{l|en|theistic}}
* {{l|en|monotheistically}}

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|atheistic}}
* {{l|en|polytheistic}}

